{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/27520-rules-clarification-please-for-spirit-claimed","id":27520,"title":"Rules Clarification, Please, For Spirit-Claimed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-10T14:09:10-08:00","id":27520,"title":"Rules Clarification, Please, For Spirit-Claimed","content":"On pg. 80 of <i>Predators</i>, the following is given as the system for a spirit to claim a mount:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Claim:</b> The spirit using the Numen must spend three Essence and roll Power + Finesse in an extended and contested roll versus the victim\u2019s Resolve + Composure; each roll represents one hour. If the spirit gains 50 successes between dusk and dawn, it gains permanent control of the mount. </div> </div> </div>My question here is do the 50 successes have to be reached all in one night? Reading the rest of the section on Spirit-Claimed talks about it taking quite a while for a spirit to fully claim a mount but I couldn't find anything to clarify if that was one long extended action performed over weeks or months or multiple attempts to get the 50 successes in a single 8-hour night. Logically, I'd think that it was a months-long extended action but given the power required to fully overwrite a person's psyche and physically transform the body sounds like a job for a high-powered spirit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The Man and the Beast are having an amiable picnic in that Savage\u2019s head. It\u2019s rather disturbing.&quot; <i>- Blood and Smoke: the Strix Chronicle, pg. 22</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/145-jsm3050","name":"JSM3050","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T15:02:48-08:00","id":27557,"title":"","content":"The bits talking about settling in tie mechanically to the fact that it takes a while for the spirit's Attribute and Aspect dots to be distributed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T20:26:49-08:00","id":27722,"title":"","content":"Okay. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The Man and the Beast are having an amiable picnic in that Savage\u2019s head. It\u2019s rather disturbing.&quot; <i>- Blood and Smoke: the Strix Chronicle, pg. 22</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/145-jsm3050","name":"JSM3050","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T21:05:27-08:00","id":27738,"title":"","content":"The 50 successes must be obtained in one night between dusk and dawn. Once that happens it takes time for the 